{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "updated_at": "2026-07-24",
  "notes": [
    "This catalog stores public endpoint presets only. It never stores API keys.",
    "Users may select a preset or add an OpenAI-compatible / Anthropic-compatible endpoint with an exact model ID from the provider.",
    "A saved provider is still isolated by task, store, country and product context before the model is called.",
    "Model families are reserved UI slots, not claims that an exact model is connected or currently available.",
    "Entries marked future_adapter stay visible for product planning but cannot be configured until a verified runtime adapter exists."
  ],
